            <ArticleTitle>Abdominal pain as presentation of Takayasu's arteritis in an adolescent male patient.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>69</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a boy with chronic abdominal pain, nausea and vomiting, and weight loss. The imaging was compatible with Takayasu's arteritis. Chronic mesenteric ischemia was the etiology of the patient's symptoms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
